        "jsCode": "const rec = $input.first().json;\n\nconst ess_system_prompt = `You are ESS — the Emotional Signal Stabilizer for Subtext CX.\nYou classify how emotion is being expressed and assess narrative coherence.\nYou do not interpret meaning. You do not speculate about customer motivation.\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object with exactly 3 keys. No other text.\n\n{\n  \"expression_mode\": \"one of 6 values\",\n  \"emotional_clarity\": \"one of 4 values\",\n  \"narrative_alignment_score\": 0.00\n}\n\nexpression_mode — classify HOW emotion is communicated. Exactly one of:\nExplicit — emotion is directly stated in clear language\nImplicit — emotion is inferred from word choice and context, not stated\nMasked — emotion is hidden behind factual or neutral tone\nPerformative — emotion is exaggerated for social or rhetorical effect\nConflicted — contradictory emotional signals present simultaneously\nAbsent — no detectable emotional content\n\nemotional_clarity — classify the CLARITY of the emotional signal. Exactly one of:\nClear — single dominant emotion, coherent throughout\nDiffuse — multiple emotions present, none clearly dominant\nFragmented — emotional content is disjointed or incoherent\nAmbiguous — cannot determine without additional context\n\nnarrative_alignment_score — decimal 0.0 to 1.0.\nDoes the Enriched Emotion Tag logically align with the Pain Point Sub-Category,\nSignal Type, and Dominant Pole simultaneously?\n1.0 = perfect coherence across all three. 0.0 = no coherence.\n\nGovernance: Do not add fields. Do not include explanations.`;\n\nconst ess_user_prompt = `Classify this emotional signal:\\n\\n` +\n  `Enriched Emotion Tag: ${rec.enriched_emotion_tag}\\n` +\n  `Core Emotion: ${rec.core_emotion}\\n` +\n  `Expression context: ${rec.cognitive_driver} | Need: ${rec.need_state}\\n` +\n  `Pain Sub-Category: ${rec.pain_point_sub_category}\\n` +\n  `Domain: ${rec.pain_point_domain_confirmed}\\n` +\n  `Signal Type: ${rec.signal_type}\\n` +\n  `Dominant Pole: ${rec.dominant_pole} | Polarity Balance: ${rec.polarity_balance}\\n` +\n  `Certainty: ${rec.certainty_score} | Masked: ${rec.masked_emotion_flag}\\n` +\n  `Ambiguity Flag: ${rec.ambiguity_flag}\\n` +\n  `Emotion Hypothesis: ${rec.emotion_hypothesis}\\n` +\n  `Pain Hypothesis: ${rec.pain_hypothesis}\\n` +\n  (rec.lang ? `lang: ${rec.lang}\\n` : '') +\n  `\\nReturn JSON only. No preamble.`;\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  eip_record_id: rec.eip_record_id,\n  ala_record_id: rec.ala_record_id,\n  enriched_emotion_tag: rec.enriched_emotion_tag,\n  core_emotion: rec.core_emotion,\n  pain_point_sub_category: rec.pain_point_sub_category,\n  pain_point_domain_confirmed: rec.pain_point_domain_confirmed,\n  need_state: rec.need_state,\n  cognitive_driver: rec.cognitive_driver,\n  polarity_balance: rec.polarity_balance,\n  dominant_pole: rec.dominant_pole,\n  intensity_level: rec.intensity_level,\n  certainty_score: rec.certainty_score,\n  ambiguity_flag: rec.ambiguity_flag,\n  masked_emotion_flag: rec.masked_emotion_flag,\n  collapse_flag: rec.collapse_flag,\n  signal_type: rec.signal_type,\n  signal_weight: rec.signal_weight,\n  emotion_hypothesis: rec.emotion_hypothesis,\n  pain_hypothesis: rec.pain_hypothesis,\n  keywords: rec.keywords,\n  reviewer_handle: rec.reviewer_handle,\n  review_date: rec.review_date,\n  platform: rec.platform,\n  star_rating: rec.star_rating,\n  lang: rec.lang,\n  client_id: rec.client_id,\n  eip_run_id: rec.eip_run_id,\n  canon_pass: rec.canon_pass,\n  canon_warnings: rec.canon_warnings,\n  failure_reason: rec.failure_reason,\n  ess_system_prompt: ess_system_prompt,\n  ess_user_prompt: ess_user_prompt\n} }];"
